# Jolt Physics in Blender

Upstream: https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics
Tag: v5.6.0
License: MIT (see JoltPhysics/LICENSE)

Vendored for Geometry Nodes **Jolt Solver** (black-box rigid body + constraint step).

- `CMakeLists.txt` is Blender-local. It includes upstream `Jolt/Jolt.cmake`.
- Samples / tests / viewer / GPU compute (DX12, Vulkan, Metal, CPU hair) are not built.
- Instruction set: AVX2 + FMA (x64). The bridge must use the same `JPH_USE_*` defines
  (propagated by linking the `Jolt` target).
